sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client / Upstream Service
    participant Infra as Infrastructure Layer<br/>(TLS + Auth)
    participant Trace as TraceLayer Middleware<br/>(tower-http)
    participant Router as Axum Router<br/>0.0.0.0:8080
    participant Health as Health Handler
    participant Detectors as Detectors Handler<br/>(detectors module)
    participant Regex as Regex Engine<br/>(regex crate)

    Note over Client,Regex: Content Detection Flow

    Client->>Infra: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    Infra->>Trace: Forward request<br/>(TLS terminated, auth validated)
    Trace->>Trace: Log request (INFO level)
    Trace->>Router: Route request
    Router->>Detectors: handle_text_contents()
    Detectors->>Regex: Compile & match patterns
    Regex-->>Detectors: Match results
    Detectors-->>Router: Detection response (JSON)
    Router-->>Trace: Response
    Trace->>Trace: Log response (INFO level)
    Trace-->>Infra: HTTP 200 OK
    Infra-->>Client: Detection results

    Note over Client,Regex: Health Check Flow

    Client->>Router: GET /health
    Router->>Health: Route to handler
    Health-->>Router: "healthy" (200 OK)
    Router-->>Client: "healthy"
